  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong dark command-center aesthetic, restrained cyan/red/yellow semantics, coherent cards, and a clear ROI focal point. However, the desktop hero has awkward forced line breaks and excessive empty space; mobile compresses the ledger into tiny, dense text with uneven wrapping; and the tablet/mobile headers visibly truncate the navigation, with the mobile brand label absent. These issues keep the otherwise polished system below demo-ready quality.",
